   "kind": "hook",
   "text": "How many Sears stores are still open?"
  },
  {
   "kind": "folder",
   "text": "Five. That is the whole chain. Braintree, Concord, El Paso, Orlando and Coral Gables."
  },
  {
   "kind": "chart",
   "text": "There were about 3,500 at the Kmart merger in 2005. A thousand by 2018. Then 425."
  },
  {
   "kind": "props",
   "text": "Eddie Lampert's hedge fund bought Sears out of bankruptcy in 2019 for $5.2 billion."
  },
  {
   "kind": "catalog",
   "text": "The catalog ran 105 years, from 1888 to 1993. Then the stores became the whole company."
